    "details": "<p><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"217\" data-end=\"236\">About the Event</strong></span></p>\n<p>CodeClash is back &mdash; bigger, and now open to coders across the country. Born out of Cosmos&rsquo;s mission to build a genuine coding culture, CodeClash brings together two very different coding challenges under one roof, designed so that both beginners and seasoned competitive programmers have a stage built for them.</p>\n<p>Whether you&rsquo;re just getting comfortable with code or you live for algorithmic showdowns, CodeClash has an arena for you.</p>\n<p><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"701\">Event 1: Blind Coding</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"719\">Eligibility:</strong> 1st Year &amp; 2nd Year students</p>\n<p>The one where you code without looking. Screens are covered &mdash; literally &mdash; and teams write code relying purely on logic and memory, with zero visual feedback. It&rsquo;s tense, it&rsquo;s hilarious, and it tests your fundamentals like nothing else. The team with the fewest errors at the end qualifies for the next round.</p>\n<p>Best suited for students building their coding foundations and looking for a fun, high-pressure introduction to competitive coding.</p>\n<p><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1219\">Event 2: DSA Battle</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1237\">Eligibility:</strong> 2nd-year to final-year students</p>\n<p>A head-to-head problem-solving battle for coders who already have a grip on Data Structures &amp; Algorithms. Live rounds, real-time problem sets, and a race against both the clock and your opponents. This is where accuracy and speed decide who walks away as champion.</p>\n<p>Best suited for students confident in DSA and looking to test themselves against the best.</p>\n<p><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1651\">Why Participate</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1915\">\n<li data-section-id=\"pz4a7o\" data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1717\">Two formats, one event &mdash; compete at the level that matches you</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"yi0bi2\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1784\">Certificates for all participants, trophies &amp; prizes for winners</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"o42om2\" data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1850\">A chance to be part of Cosmos&rsquo;s growing national coding culture</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"m22bhw\" data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1915\">Network with coders and CS students from campuses across India</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1930\">Format</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"2104\">\n<li data-section-id=\"4kx0wm\" data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1962\">Team-based competition (2-4)</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hchydt\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2051\"><strong data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1977\">Round 1:</strong> Basic assessment includes a quiz, and then there will be two rounds of coding</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1a1cun7\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2104\"><strong data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2066\">Round 2:</strong> Finals &mdash; top teams battle it out live</li>\n</ul>",
    "end_date": "2026-10-01T00:00:00+05:30",
